## Slow computer?
| symptom | what to add to the `sim.launch.py` command |
|---|---|
| robot drives in circles or never reaches the goal | `rtf:=0.5` — the simulation runs at half speed so Nav2 keeps up (try `rtf:=0.25` on a very slow PC or VM) |
| Gazebo window is slow or stays black | `gui:=false` — physics and sensors still run, watch the robot in RViz |
| no GPU (VM, WSL, remote desktop) | `export LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1` before the launch |

